      "amount": "1 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "Black pepper",
      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large skillet, heat olive oil over medium high heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the ground beef and cook until it is browned.",
    "Add the red bell pepper and cook until it is tender.",
    "Deglaze the skillet with beef broth and stir to combine.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Unroll the phyllo dough and cut it into 4 inch squares.",
    "Place a tablespoon of the beef mixture onto the center of each square.",
    "Fold the dough into a triangle and press the edges together to seal."
  ],
